## Original Content
<p align="center"></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><img alt="" height="600" src="/NMediaFile/2025/0605/MAIN1749084432301V0WCWJAZF1.jpg" width="900" /></p> <p></p> <p>　　6月4日，在位于纽约的联合国总部，联合国大会举行会议改选联合国经济及社会理事会（经社理事会）部分成员。</p> <p>　　联合国大会4日改选联合国经济及社会理事会（经社理事会）部分成员，中国成功连任。</p> <p>　　新华社发（联合国供图/曼努埃尔·埃利亚斯摄）</p> <!-- pagebreak --> <p align="center"></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><img alt="" height="600" src="/NMediaFile/2025/0605/MAIN1749084455321UJYRDIF140.jpg" width="900" /></p> <p></p> <p align="center" class="pictext">　　6月4日，在位于纽约的联合国总部，联合国大会工作人员收集选票。</p> <p>　　联合国大会4日改选联合国经济及社会理事会（经社理事会）部分成员，中国成功连任。</p> <p>　　新华社发（联合国供图/曼努埃尔·埃利亚斯摄）</p> <!-- pagebreak --> <p align="center"></p> <p style="text-align: center;"><img alt="" height="600" src="/NMediaFile/2025/0605/MAIN1749084480584WZ6M77CF6D.jpg" width="900" /></p> <p></p> <p>　　6月4日，在位于纽约的联合国总部，第79届联大主席菲勒蒙·扬（左）主持联合国大会会议，改选联合国经济及社会理事会（经社理事会）部分成员。</p> <p>　　联合国大会4日改选联合国经济及社会理事会（经社理事会）部分成员，中国成功连任。</p> <p>　　新华社发（联合国供图/曼努埃尔·埃利亚斯摄）</p>

## Summary
On June 4, the UN General Assembly re-elected some members of the Economic and Social Council (ECOSOC), with China successfully retaining its membership. The meeting was held at the UN headquarters in New York and presided over by Philémon Young, the 79th UN General Assembly President.

## Key Points
- China was re-elected to the UN Economic and Social Council.
- The re-election occurred on June 4 at the UN headquarters in New York.
- Philémon Young, the 79th UN General Assembly President, presided over the meeting.
- The event was reported by Xinhua News Agency.


